        "substituted": 0,
        "sub_ratio": 0.0,
        "longest_deletion": 0,
        "transcript": "马德里第三轮出局,罗马止步八强。到了法网,先以6比1拿下手盘,他却被比勒尔连追两盘,手轮出局。"
      },
      "polyphones": [],
      "pauses": {
        "inner_pauses": [],
        "fake_tokens": [],
        "chars": 41,
        "speech_s": 9.222,
        "cps": 4.45,
        "pause_ok": true,
        "speed_ok": true,
        "tokens": "马德里 ｜ 第三轮 ｜ 出局 ｜ 罗马 ｜ 止步 ｜ 8 ｜ 强 ｜ 到 ｜ 了 ｜ 法网 ｜ 先 ｜ 以 ｜ 六比一 ｜ 拿下 ｜ 首盘 ｜ 她 ｜ 却 ｜ 被 ｜ 比勒尔 ｜ 连 ｜ 追 ｜ 两盘 ｜ 首轮 ｜ 出局"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1a778ad11952af9440bb97e47350b26711010cc86bae29e75f161a72289d50aa",
      "text": "印第安维尔斯、迈阿密，她都止步8强，两次负于莱巴金娜。",
      "pass": true,
      "checks": {
        "completeness": true,
        "polyphones": true,
        "pauses": true,
        "speed": true
      },
      "completeness": {
        "ok": true,
        "ref_syllables": 23,
        "deleted": 0,
        "inserted": 0,
        "substituted": 0,
        "sub_ratio": 0.0,
        "longest_deletion": 0,
        "transcript": "印第安威尔斯、麦阿密他都只不扒墙,两次赋予来扒金娜。"
      },
      "polyphones": [],
      "pauses": {
        "inner_pauses": [],
        "fake_tokens": [],
        "chars": 23,
        "speech_s": 4.859,
        "cps": 4.73,
        "pause_ok": true,
        "speed_ok": true,
        "tokens": "印第安维尔斯 ｜ 迈阿密 ｜ 她 ｜ 都 ｜ 止步 ｜ 8 ｜ 强 ｜ 两次 ｜ 负 ｜ 于 ｜ 莱巴金娜"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4b2bf9126fd0d1fc5ff3dc236dc1178cf031c11cfc83ff44b8ef44959915f43f",
      "text": "到了查尔斯顿，她连打四场三盘，撑进决赛。决赛六比二、六比二击败斯塔罗杜布采娃，拿到本赛季第二冠。",
      "pass": true,
      "checks": {
        "completeness": true,
        "polyphones": true,
        "pauses": true,
        "speed": true
      },
      "completeness": {
        "ok": true,
        "ref_syllables": 42,
        "deleted": 0,
        "inserted": 0,
        "substituted": 0,
        "sub_ratio": 0.0,
        "longest_deletion": 0,
        "transcript": "到了查尔斯顿,他连打四场三盘,撑进决赛。决赛6比2,6比2,击败斯塔罗杜布采娃,拿到本赛季第二罐。"
      },
